    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "organizations? what's going to change? i've already seen how this ends. the \"community\" is just a bunch of people who are as broken as i am, just waiting for their turn to get crushed. it feels like there's no real way back to a normal life. everything i spent years building, just gone. it's like there's no point in even trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken. why do people keep telling me to keep fighting when the math just doesn't add up?",
